Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:12.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.66,0:00:18.86,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.20,0:00:25.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:31.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.21,0:00:48.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:54.95,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:01:01.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.51,0:01:07.17,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:13.78,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:25.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一大群百鬼蝙蝠…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:02:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第74话 破除结界的红色铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是百鬼蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往村子的方向去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还在发什么呆 走了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:41.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:50.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子被…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要在意 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是欺负你与你母亲的人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:03:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安心吧 只要你好好保护结界与我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.24,0:03:03.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就会救你母亲的命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用客气 吞掉整个村子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死老头 我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.27,0:03:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,碍眼的臭小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.50,0:03:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.48,0:03:35.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.15,0:03:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 弥勒 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.79,0:03:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.46,0:03:51.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很慢耶 在磨蹭什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来到底有几只啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样根本没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杂鱼就由我对付
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:00.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.81,0:04:11.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然能轻易弹回飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.46,0:04:22.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要紫织在 我就无法使用风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.96,0:04:25.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,束手无策了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有办法将紫织 从大狱丸的身边拉开吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:37.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想办法对付他们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会被杀光的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是村里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用你们拜托 我也会砍了大狱丸那老头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.12,0:04:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是是在夺回紫织之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:50.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样太慢了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的是 紫织是百鬼蝙蝠的同伙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要一起杀掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:04:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是不得已的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.76,0:05:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁叫紫织是妖怪的小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好过分…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然为了村子 而让紫织与母亲分离
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.44,0:05:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送到百鬼蝙蝠的巢穴里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是任性的一群人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.21,0:05:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉不是最讨厌这种家伙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.28,0:05:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为曾经遭受相同的待遇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.79,0:05:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到了吧 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.46,0:05:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底想怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:36.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到有这些家伙的村子里 说不定也不会有啥好事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.87,0:05:39.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样还是想回来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.10,0:05:41.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.24,0:05:43.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是白天与妈妈 一起来到巢穴的…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使这样你还是想回来 我就帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:49.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮她？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.81,0:05:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 你以为你打的赢我大狱丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:05:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 你也是半妖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑身都是半妖的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆 是又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.77,0:06:22.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会是把紫织 想成和自己一样而可怜她的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.28,0:06:24.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:28.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是很讨厌你这种臭老头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:30.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,半妖？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人…和我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织 马上做决定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.30,0:06:40.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要回去还是不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想回去…回到妈妈的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:51.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:59.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白吧 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不以结界保护我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲的性命就不保
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.89,0:07:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.56,0:07:11.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么办才好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 不要蛊惑紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织 你只要保护自己就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:33.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是结界的力量…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:40.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得好 紫织 这样就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.23,0:07:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然 我想只要让大狱丸\N身体的一部分离开结界就有胜算
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是紫织好像还无法 自由控制结界的大小
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险 大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.97,0:08:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:29.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.97,0:08:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这村子已经没有用了 你们全都去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.62,0:08:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再继续下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.75,0:08:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子在你儿子月夜丸 活着的时候是很和平的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为月夜丸殿下保护了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.23,0:08:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他希望我与紫织平静生活 而没有袭击这个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你了解月夜丸所留下的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子所留下的心愿？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.66,0:09:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.79,0:09:27.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月夜丸…既是我的儿子 也是愚蠢的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会迷恋人类女人 所以才这么早断送性命
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:35.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你所说 月夜丸说过要保护这个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:45.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不成全他
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.18,0:09:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就舍弃继承自我大狱丸 守护结界的地位
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.05,0:09:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不惜离开我族
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:58.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙已经连心 都让人类女人夺去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:09:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:01.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该不会将自己的儿子…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:17.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 就是我送月夜丸上路的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:27.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有了紫织 就不需要那小子了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母 您振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:34.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸 我绝对饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:37.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.60,0:10:46.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是正如所见 紫织还没有能控制结界大小的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一你的刀劈开结界
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.61,0:10:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时紫织也会和我一起死的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.62,0:10:56.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:11:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有胜算吗 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够不伤害紫织 只砍到大狱丸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织还无法控制结界
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.90,0:11:13.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算顺利击破结界 也会连大狱丸与紫织都…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:20.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打算怎样砍我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.64,0:11:22.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 老鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.78,0:11:23.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再手下留情了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之前都是手下留情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就让我见识一下 你的真本事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招 爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.43,0:11:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的结界因为那老头 吐出妖气的洞而打开了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爆流破的漩涡应该 能通过那里击中老头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.44,0:11:58.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子刀的妖气竟然 将我的妖气卷入向我冲过来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:12:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样贯穿那老头的脑袋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.93,0:12:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结界扭曲了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:28.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又恢复原状了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸毫发无伤
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:33.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是差了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好紫织 就这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.23,0:12:45.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是父亲的仇人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的紫织 不过是个半妖竟然将我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.12,0:13:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 这丫头竟然拥有这种程度的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连我大狱丸都无法如此自由的操纵结界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.63,0:13:19.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算孙女是半妖 也绝对不能将紫织交给人类
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.78,0:13:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯母 危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.41,0:13:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.15,0:13:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老鬼快上路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:47.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是爆流破
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.54,0:14:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.44,0:14:07.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:10.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位~
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.81,0:14:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.19,0:14:16.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.55,0:14:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:27.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你受苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.83,0:14:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.60,0:14:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 再待着也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:38.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家 回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么 犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷 你还在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:46.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你忘记来这里的目的了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:50.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是应该要砍杀 布下强大结界的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:56.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让铁碎牙吸取鲜血 以创造更强的铁碎牙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.39,0:14:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来砍杀紫织的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.23,0:15:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没沦落到会去砍那小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:08.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对方是那么小的女生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.14,0:15:10.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且都是半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再去找能布下 更强大结界的坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后砍了他就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前不是这种人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:22.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思 就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.52,0:15:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是犬夜叉成长了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.03,0:15:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么 我们告辞了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.39,0:15:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.77,0:15:37.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍这颗玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.05,0:15:57.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你砍了它
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.69,0:16:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这颗血玉珊瑚是 负责守护百鬼蝙蝠结界之人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.79,0:16:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代代相传的宝玉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能引出守护者的力量 制造强大的结界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且据说它积蓄着代代的守护者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:17.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的爷爷与父亲的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我想 如果砍了它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀的妖力应该就能更强
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可求之不得啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:29.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷 快点砍吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.49,0:16:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我也觉得 早点解决掉它比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从玉散发出邪气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.47,0:16:43.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快放手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.17,0:16:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈 你的手…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉张开了结界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:58.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让我们那么简单的砍了它吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:01.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是不这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:16.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别想逃走 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.54,0:17:29.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是爷爷的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开玉也无法切断与我们一族的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算你是人类母亲所生的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.06,0:17:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大狱丸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.36,0:17:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.73,0:17:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死老鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织！和我一起下地狱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:58.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被弹开了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.25,0:18:13.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.39,0:18:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:21.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老鬼的妖力变弱了 趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让紫织自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉破掉了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.89,0:18:49.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次真的结束了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:58.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀刃变红了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:01.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙吸取了玉的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.97,0:19:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是刀变强了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.92,0:19:19.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.32,0:19:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:24.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你帮了我的忙不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.19,0:19:26.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你减弱了那老鬼的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.26,0:19:30.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 那不是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.27,0:19:33.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是有人用温柔的手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.47,0:19:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱住了我与妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.44,0:19:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是月夜丸殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.18,0:19:44.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你父亲的手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:53.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伯父的愿望一定也是 紫织能够自由吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.69,0:19:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.96,0:20:01.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肚子好饿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.03,0:20:04.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:10.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也想要拯救紫织
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.37,0:20:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定连让铁碎牙变强的事都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:21.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以伯父的思念 才会助犬夜叉一臂之力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:31.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉在想些什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:36.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷居然也会沉思 真是稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:39.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 往后那对母女会很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.35,0:20:48.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别做多余的操心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:52.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是怕辛苦怎么当半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:57.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 这里就有个榜样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.33,0:20:59.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不那么别扭就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.37,0:21:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才像是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:07.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.27,0:21:12.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是会沉思的犬夜叉 就不像犬夜叉了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.55,0:21:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 不习惯的事情就别再做了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.95,0:21:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把你们丢下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 我们是在担心你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.19,0:21:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要当我是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.06,0:21:29.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,掉下去我不管喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.06,0:21:34.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉在离别的时候 什么话都没有对紫织说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是要加油 要更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:41.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿出勇气来等等的话 应该有很多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想犬夜叉是用话语 以外的方式传达给紫织吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.25,0:21:49.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定传达到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.59,0:21:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.82,0:21:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.62,0:21:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说不要把我当狗啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.69,0:22:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.33,0:22:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 你也来这套
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:03.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好乖好乖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:05.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要发飚啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.57,0:22:09.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唉呀呀 真不该跟来的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:21.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.12,0:22:28.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.89,0:22:35.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:41.69,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:48.33,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.77,0:22:55.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:23:02.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.62,0:23:09.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.40,0:23:15.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.17,0:23:22.63,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.91,0:23:29.41,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.72,0:23:36.12,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.30,0:23:51.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,春夏秋冬四姐弟 率领的猫妖一族
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.90,0:23:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豹猫族从西边来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.44,0:23:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的目标是四魂碎片与犬夜叉少爷的性命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.21,0:23:58.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙我根本不认识
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.78,0:24:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事情的源由是五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与杀生丸少爷有关的那场大战
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.72,0:24:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不正好是犬夜叉被封印的时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.79,0:24:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.22,0:24:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豹猫四天王的阴谋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意思 我奉陪到底！
